            "text": "¡Entendido! Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que recupera los conceptos ancestros jerárquicos del `concept_id` 192671 (Hemorragia gastrointestinal), incluyendo el nivel de separación ontológica, utilizando las tablas `concept_ancestor` y `concept`.\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    ca.ancestor_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name AS ancestor_concept_name,\n    c.domain_id AS ancestor_domain,\n    ca.min_levels_of_separation\nFROM\n    `concept_ancestor` AS ca\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\nON\n    ca.ancestor_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    ca.descendant_concept_id = 192671\nORDER BY\n    ca.min_levels_of_separation DESC, c.concept_name;\n```",
