            "text": "Gracias por la retroalimentación del evaluador clínico/técnico. He revisado y mejorado la consulta SQL para BigQuery OMOP CDM 5.4, incorporando los filtros críticos y la información adicional solicitada.\n\nAquí tienes la consulta SQL corregida y ejecutable:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    ca.ancestor_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name AS ancestor_concept_name,\n    c.domain_id AS ancestor_domain,\n    c.concept_code,\n    c.concept_class_id,\n    c.vocabulary_id,\n    ca.min_levels_of_separation,\n    ca.max_levels_of_separation\nFROM\n    `concept_ancestor` AS ca\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\nON\n    ca.ancestor_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    ca.descendant_concept_id = 192671\n    AND ca.ancestor_concept_id != 192671 -- Excluye el concepto descendiente de la lista de ancestros\n    AND c.invalid_reason IS NULL        -- Filtra conceptos que no son válidos\nORDER BY\n    ca.min_levels_of_separation DESC, c.concept_name;\n```",
